    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A courageous truth-teller in Sikar sent an email to the responsible authority, India's National Testing Agency, with leaked exam materials. This critical disclosure revealed that PDFs matched 100% of the chemistry questions. The agency acted to initiate an investigation, referring the matter to the investigative agency. This painful but necessary reset of the medical entrance exam, a test of trust, seeks to restore fairness for the students who were wronged, offering them a path to restoring fairness through a second examination.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Following the exam invalidation, the government body referred a group of potentially accused individuals, including paper setters and translators, to the investigation agency. This led to the detention of suspects and the pursuit of accountability, with those facing legal consequences arrested. The outcome underscores a commitment to integrity, though it is a source of great sorrow for the education professional now implicated, who had once championed student justice.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "From the origin of a crucial tip, a person provided evidence of a systemic breach to the testing agency. The receipt of this information was a pivotal step, leading the institution to take remedial action by scheduling a second examination. This planned event, an opportunity for a fair chance, represents a sincere effort to repair the harm and trust broken by the breach, aiming to provide a fair chance for all aspirants.",
